\par\par \b \uc2  U.S.  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt/Yen-3: Power Shift To Bureaucrats From LDP \b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Juni 1998\par 00:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The Japanese government is routinely depicted these days as an administration in paralysis, to the point that traders often wonder whether Tokyo's bureaucrats comprehend the magnitude of the economic crisis confronting Asia. \par \par \uc2  If Tokyo's bureaucrats don't take decisive action soon, the hope for stabilizing Asia's economy will turn to China, perhaps presaging a historic weakening of Japan's role in the region, notes Paul Spirgel, a dealer at Royal Bank of Scotland in New York. \par \par \uc2  Often, fingers of blame are pointed at Japan's seemingly complex politics and long-running battles between the bureaucrats within the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the powerbrokers of the ruling Liberal Democratic Party (LDP). \par \par \uc2  A string of financial scandals, coupled with some major economic policy mistakes, appears to have weakened the position of MOF officials in recent months and granted ascendancy to LDP leaders. Kevin Harris, international economist with MCM \b \highlight22\uc2 CurrencyWatch\b0 \highlight\uc2 , fears that this shift in the power balance has empowered a clique of mercantilists within the LDP who misguidedly believe the solution to Japan's woes is to let the yen fall. \par \par \uc2  "They are somewhat benighted in thinking they can export their way out of trouble ... it ignores the fact that Asia is crumbling," Harris said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reluctance to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday in Tokyo at the "perfect opportunity" when some big investors were bailing out of yen was evidence of a shift towards this mercantilist approach, he said. The BOJ's absence in the market only facilitated some cheap dollar buying and a subsequent rebound in the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Harris said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 16-06-98 \par \par \uc2  2222GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6g055c9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
