\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar eases vs yen in Tokyo on Yamasaki remarks. \b0\par\par\uc2 475 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juni 1998\par 02:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      TOKYO, June 9 (Reuters) - ASIAN \b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  ACTIVITY: \par \par \uc2      0026 GMT --*Dollar fell against yen following report \par \par \uc2  quoting Japan LDP official Taku Yamasaki saying he asked \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  to act aggressively on \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \par \par \uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2      *Traders said caution over dollar's recent rapid rally \par \par \uc2  weighed on dollar against yen in early trade, although no \par \par \uc2  traces of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  detected so far. \par \par \uc2      *Finance Minister Hikaru Matsunaga said not correct to \par \par \uc2  assume that G7 deputies meeting in Paris this week will not \par \par \uc2  discuss \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which helped cap dollar's rise against yen. \par \par \uc2  *"Since the dollar's recent rise was rapid, caution has grown in the markets," said a dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  *He said dollar may find its near-term top at 142 yen. \par \par \uc2  *MOF's Matsunaga said: "Although Russia will be the main issue, media reports that they will not discuss \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are not correct. We are always discussing and keeping contact among G7 countries on \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  *"We have strong worries over an excessive yen weakness. We will take decisive measures as needed in cooperation with the G7 nations," he said. \par \par \uc2  *Stop-loss dollar sales induced at around 140.50 yen, briefly sending it to around 140.20 yen, said a bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  *But short-term speculators quickly stepped in to buy dollars after falls, supporting dollar, he added. \par \par \uc2  *"The focus is on whether the dollar will be supported at around New York's low of 140.10 yen," he added. \par \par \uc2  *Jiji news agency said Yamasaki, policy chief of the ruling Liberal Democratic Party, told morning meeting of economic ministers and other officials: "The finance minister's expression that the government is ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  is praiseworthy, but we must monitor its effects." \par \par \uc2  * "I asked for an aggressive response," Yamasaki said, according to Jiji. The agency said Yamasaki quoted Matsunaga as replying: "I understand." \par \par \uc2  *Japan's Trade Minister Mitsuo Horiuchi said on Tuesday that the timing of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  was vital and that they should be done when market trends were changing. \par \par \uc2  2308 GMT - *Dollar hit 141 yen in early Asian trade, highest level since June 1991, reflecting bearish sentiment for yen, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  *Stop-loss dollar buying temporarily sent it as high as 141.35 yen in thin market. \par \par \uc2  *Australian dollar weighed down against U.S. dollar by yen's recent fall, with dealers in Tokyo saying Reserve Bank of Australia seen supporting Aussie through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  *Talk one-week dollar call options with strikes of 142 yen traded on Monday, said a trust bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  *Concern about possible dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) lingered, encouraging traders to take dollar short positions and also making it difficult for BOJ to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  effectively, dealers said. ((Tokyo Treasury Desk 81-3-3432-1396 email:tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6903g51\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
