2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in order to slow the dollar's rise against the yen. The dollar has climbed nearly 5% from an intraday low of Y133.49 on May 15. \par \par \uc2  Indeed, Japan's Finance Ministry indicated Tuesday that it's not only concerned about what it perceives as the yen's excessive weakness against the dollar, but also the speed at which the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has weakened recently. \par \par \uc2  "I'm referring to both the speed of the yen's decline as well as the level of the yen when I say excessive," Haruhiko Kuroda, the head of the ministry's international finance bureau, told reporters early Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 02-06-98 \par \par \uc2  0615GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6204oxx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
