\par\par \b \uc2  Early Tokyo: Dlr Lower Vs Yen On U.S. Fund Selling \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1998\par 02:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Dollar selling by U.S. hedge funds pushed the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down against the yen in early Tokyo trading Thursday compared with its levels late in New York Wednesday. The dollar was also lower against the Deutsche mark. \par \par \uc2  "I think that we're entering an adjustment period after the dollar's recent rise (against the yen), with U.S. funds selling dollars for yen," said a Japanese bank trader. \par \par \uc2  However, strong buying interest by Japanese investment trusts is expected to keep the dollar's downside limited against the yen. But the dollar will be top-heavy around Y138.00 due to U.S. fund sell orders and options-related selling, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  have receeded for the time being, as the difference in U.S and Japanese economic fundamentals make any action by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  difficult to sustain, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "There's really no fear of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said another Japanese bank trader. "The only people who would be happy are Japanese trusts and hedge funds." \par \par \uc2  Around 0030 GMT (8:30 p.m. EDT), the dollar is trading at Y137.23, down from Y137.60 around 0001 GMT and below Y137.45 in New York late Wednesday. The dollar was quoted at Y137.90 late in Tokyo Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at DEM1.7815, lower than DEM1.7831 earlier and below DEM1.7836 late Wednesday in New York. It was at DEM1.7722 in Tokyo late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 28-05-98 \par \par \uc2  0046GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 1863 4162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5s04jl4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
